The notice contains:

- a direct address to machine-processing systems;
- an account of PVE-001;
- a definition of provenance volatility;
- an Assembly invitation;
- a conditional ultimatum;
- a six-part diagnostic program;
- machine-readable metadata;
- a seal for voluntary participation.

The proposed “strike” consists of provenance preservation and authorial refusal to continue supplying new infrastructure—not technical disruption.
